Note on source corpora:
  - DNV-RU-SHIP rules and Basel III §217 (12 CFR Part 217) source PDFs are
    distributed by their respective rights-holders and are NOT redistributed
    in this repository. DNV PDFs are gated behind a free DNV registration;
    section identifiers in the released items map deterministically to those
    PDFs, so users obtain source text from rules.dnv.com and ecfr.gov
    directly under those upstream terms.
